# LCV-172 AC 8 — a mid-path syntax error (`L 50` lacks its y) keeps the
# segments before it, is reported, and the file still opens with the next
# path. World y = 100 - svg y.
bed 100 100
layer "Cut" #ff0000 output=1 current=1
line 0 10 90 30 90
line 0 30 90 30 70
line 0 60 90 80 90
ignored 1 path (data error)
